{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016003006255-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016011642\"/><p>事發在太安街。</p><p>昨日(15日)中午1時16分，有途人報案，指發現一名年約50歲女子將一狗隻從西灣河太安街29號對開岸邊扔下海，其後檢起該狗隻逃去。警員接報到場，經初步調查，案件列「殘酷對待動物」，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:55.031586+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T16:30:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T02:57:57.464799+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:52.886451+00:00","content_hash":"24dd5dbec341ecba04be458af8ec34772671208015a0b52b41602bcf2fbb238c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}